    <title lang="fr">Evita</title>
    <desc lang="fr">She was considered the most powerful woman of her time. Together with Juan Domingo Perón she formed a legendary partnership that was a mixture of both fairy tale and of political struggle. The trajectory of a figure that inspired both unconditional love, and bitter hatred, and who, decades after her death, continues to influence Argentine politics.</desc>
