    <desc>It's the second day of the Alabama Turkey season,  and we hit the woods with Dr. Mike Chamberlain and Aaron Warbritton from The Hunting Public in search of a longbeard. Watching turkeys just being turkeys, and spending time with great friends is why turkey hunting is just different to us.</desc>
  </programme>
  
